11. Research Program and Identification Strategy

11.1 Identification strategy

The v0.2 operational model had twelve free parameters (seven elasticities, four lags, and  \lambda ) and four calibration cases. This is a severe degrees-of-freedom problem. The v0.3 identification strategy addresses this explicitly.

Parameter classification:

Parameter Classification Identification strategy
